{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47483","headline":"七言 四十二 · 吕岩","name":"七言 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳杳冥冥莫问涯，雕虫篆刻道之华。\n守中绝学方知奥，抱一无言始见佳。\n自有物如黄菊蘂，更无色似碧桃花。\n休将心地虚劳用，煮铁烧金转转差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}